SUMMARY:Norwalk's Black Heritage Parade
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261011
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261012
DTSTAMP:20260929T164738Z
UID:ae200fed550cba1e8d84b5f3ff85@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:​This isn’t just a parade - it’s a movement. A moment to
  honor the rich contributions of Black individuals in Norwalk and beyond\,
  while creating space for joy\, reflection\, and unity. From marching band
 s and local performers to community leaders and youth groups\, this event 
 will be a colorful and powerful expression of who we are - and we’d love
  for you to be a part of it. Join us as we explore and promote the beauty 
 of our history and cultivate pride in our heritage.\n\nSource: https://ctv
 isit.com/events/norwalks-black-heritage-parade-0
LOCATION:Washington Street Plaza\, 50 Washington St\, Norwalk CT\, 06854
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/norwalks-black-heritage-parade-0
END:VEVENT
